    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCharming four-bedroom mid terraced town house, located in the heart of Charlestown. \n\nThis lovely property comes to the market in very good condition, and is ready for immediate occupation. It is centrally located in Charlestown, within a short walk of all of the amenities that the town has to offer. \n\nThe spacious property has two generously proportioned reception rooms on the ground floor as well as a recently installed kitchen. This living space is complimented by four good-sized bedrooms on the first floor.\n\nTo the rear, there is a spacious garden with a large stone outbuilding which could be useful for storage or for a workshop. The property also benefits from rear access via a shared roadway.\n\nTurbary rights are included with this property and are situated on the Swinford Road. \n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1m x 6.6m\nWith lamiante floor and carpet staircase leading to the first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 6.6m x 3.8m\nLarge bright room with carpet floor, double aspect windows to the front and rear allowing for lots of natural light and an open fireplace with a timber surround.\n\nSitting Room - 6.6m x 3m\nWith a carpet floor, in-set stove and built-in storage.\n\nKitchen - 3.7m x 2.6m\nWith a tile floor, fitted kitchen with intergrated oven microwave and hob and a door leading to the rear of the house.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.2m\nDouble room to the front of the house with carpet floor and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 2.1m\nSingle room to the front of the house with carpet floor and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.2m x 3.1m\nDouble room to the front of the house with solid timber floor and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.3m x 2.3m\nDouble room to the rear of the house with carpet floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.9m x 2m\nWith carpet floor, half tile walls, WC, wash hand basin, bathtub and seperate shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil-Fired Central Heating.</li><li>Double glazed windows. </li><li>Town-Centre location. </li><li>House in very good condition.</li><li>Spacious site to rear with large stone outbuilding. </li><li>Rear access.</ul>"
      },
